Subject: Re: Can semTools::reliability() deal with single-indicator-latents?
Message-ID: <UMBjHqltTj8.48RI9ghnAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <UMBjHqltTj8.z-VCCxUcAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
